 	\begin{equation}
 	1+ax^{2^{k+1}-2}+a^{-2^{k+1}-1}x^{2^{k+1}}=0
 	\label{key1}    	
 	\end{equation}
 	has no solution in $\mathbb{F}_{q}$.
 	Raising (\ref{key1}) to the $2^{k}$-th power, we have
