The corrected shipping rung at \(k=10\) has failed two of its three bare oracle attempts so far, one per provider. These are genuine wrong/no-answer outcomes, not parser failures; I’m waiting on the final scored attempt.
diff --git a/results/1508.07590/gen_1508_07590.py b/results/1508.07590/gen_1508_07590.py
